{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1d5769b2491d0cb7","type":"text","text":"Add and connect to it a card with the opening dialogue, explaining where it is set and what is happening It should lead up to the fight of the scenario.","x":-1001,"y":624,"width":250,"height":203},
		{"id":"6b4644f818b48fbd","type":"text","text":"Stoneseeker Camps\nPay Glory to buy rare Equipment cards. Available in peaceful places.","x":195,"y":-36,"width":250,"height":131},
		{"id":"844c8308921c448b","type":"text","text":"Bonus Fights\nDefeat them to get extra rewards or unlock extra actions in the scenario.","x":480,"y":-36,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"67850c281c30cce8","type":"text","text":"Recruitment Nodes\nAccess to buy cards from your recruitment pool. Avalable in populated areas, unavailable in places away from people (dungeons, temples, woods)","x":480,"y":115,"width":250,"height":205},
		{"id":"2a76525430c9b08c","type":"text","text":"Extra Nodes","x":480,"y":-230,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"80af7d982d4fa0a1","type":"text","text":"Mandatory Nodes","x":-449,"y":-230,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3f096c7bc5eedae4","type":"text","text":"Node Types","x":70,"y":-420,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f54dd7303fcd7a6c","type":"text","text":"Battle Nodes\nRequired. One or more battles that can be fought in a scenario. Battles usually reward Glory and 1 card from a choice of 3 from the deck of the opponent.\nUnless stated otherwise, the battle node must be beaten to progress to next scenario.","x":-820,"y":-30,"width":291,"height":250},
		{"id":"5c0fbfb3ed2194e4","type":"text","text":"Comments In Text","x":70,"y":400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"40d25dbf8237985d","type":"text","text":"(Display x Card)","x":-276,"y":575,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"49e307338b48b8a5","type":"text","text":"A card will appear in the cutscene bar.","x":120,"y":575,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4015ee34e81203a1","type":"text","text":"(Hide x Card/Cards)","x":-276,"y":685,"width":250,"height":55},
		{"id":"2471d39d6a5ff447","type":"text","text":"Relevant cards will disappear from the cutscene bar.","x":120,"y":665,"width":250,"height":95},
		{"id":"0f30905b2e0cd64b","type":"text","text":"Relevant nodes will be unlocked. Refer to the Node Types map to see which are available.","x":120,"y":794,"width":250,"height":126},
		{"id":"2344c4d26e69024b","type":"text","text":"Rest Nodes\nAccess to use your character's special command or restore HP Available in peaceful places.","x":195,"y":133,"width":250,"height":185},
		{"id":"c07a75dee2cff26b","type":"text","text":"(Unlock Node/Nodes)","x":-276,"y":827,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"da2171657d0bb7cb","type":"text","text":"Gives the player an alliance with the x group, allowing buying their rare cards in Recruitment Nodes","x":117,"y":959,"width":250,"height":121},
		{"id":"db2b8a2e91a30d09","type":"text","text":"(Add alliance: x)","x":-276,"y":990,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ebbc939648101f65","type":"text","text":"IF [CONDITION]:","x":480,"y":575,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"25ca66bb0997dee2","type":"text","text":"[BBCode tag]...[/BBCode tag]","x":480,"y":740,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4bcfb6f55573015b","type":"text","text":"BBCode is used by Godot to add visual effects to text. For example, Achra's colored text is created using BBCode. ","x":820,"y":692,"width":250,"height":157},
		{"id":"408e3e58d56fec21","type":"text","text":"To see what BBCode tags exist, refer to:\n[BBCode in RichTextLabel — Godot Engine (stable) documentation in English](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/ui/bbcode_in_richtextlabel.html)","x":1180,"y":690,"width":250,"height":161},
		{"id":"564ab8e655f4e425","type":"text","text":"Dialogue/Choices below only show up if [CONDITION] is met","x":820,"y":560,"width":250,"height":90},
		{"id":"4470a001d1cf4313","type":"text","text":"Rules of Writing","x":1545,"y":-420,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1e2c0b95bae80f70","type":"text","text":"1. A scenario must offer at least one fight and a choice of rewards.","x":1545,"y":-296,"width":250,"height":96},
		{"id":"de54139c1f0223be","type":"text","text":"2. The player character's gender, race, identity, emotions and thoughts should be kept as ambiguous as possible, to accomodate for as many roleplay styles as possible. The most the player should know about the player character is that they are humanoid. \n   Other characters refer to the player character by name or title.","x":1500,"y":-155,"width":340,"height":288},
		{"id":"8007c22d9a549af7","type":"text","text":"3. Each character is a representative of their faction first and a person after. While building scenarios around named, unique characters is not prohibitied, their conflict still must be related to the greater group they are part of. Writing needs to be done in character, following the style guides outlined in mindmaps with faction lore.","x":1500,"y":175,"width":340,"height":285},
		{"id":"d995ff2dae68f18d","type":"text","text":"Adds a card to the player's army. Most cards added this way are Epic/Champion cards","x":126,"y":1116,"width":250,"height":124},
		{"id":"f90e45fe9dcfc9dc","type":"text","text":"(Add card: x)","x":-276,"y":1144,"width":250,"height":68},
		{"id":"5c9122ac9f91fa97","type":"text","text":"So you want to make a Scenario?","x":-1000,"y":370,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"f83ddc29f675ae0d","type":"text","text":"Start by adding a card with the name of the scenario.","x":-1000,"y":500,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"96a9e4dd7c02e5a6","type":"text","text":"Add a card with a comment (Unlock Battle Node). This would be the scenario's fight. Below, you can write out who is fought and the comments and flavor text about the battle.","x":-1000,"y":913,"width":250,"height":203},
		{"id":"ee1ccd72aba066e9","x":-1001,"y":1182,"width":250,"height":98,"type":"text","text":"Add below a card which explains the aftermath of the battle. "},
		{"id":"8f7b2fea3ef11954","type":"text","text":"Places of Power\nPay Glory to permanently increase the stats of one of your cards. Avalable in holy places that welcome you.","x":780,"y":-51,"width":250,"height":151},
		{"id":"fa9898569045d856","x":794,"y":149,"width":222,"height":171,"type":"text","text":"Loot Node\nWhen clicked, gives the player Glory or cards. Available after winning a fight."},
		{"id":"285079cf3f75d835","x":1055,"y":122,"width":250,"height":196,"type":"text","text":"Upgrade Node\nUpgrade your cards for Glory, choosing one of the 3 upgrade paths. Available in civilized or densely populated areas."},
		{"id":"ef8e11a4d34c006f","x":-1001,"y":1360,"width":250,"height":160,"type":"text","text":"Finish with a card with a comment (Unlock Exit Node). Congratulations, you created a minimum viable scenario."},
		{"id":"df5e8e77856b9a52","x":-455,"y":13,"width":250,"height":174,"type":"text","text":"Exit Node\nWhen pressed, the player will leave the scenario and will be presented with a choice of the next one."},
		{"id":"5441d0afc489adf1","type":"text","text":"Dialog Nodes\nContains a choice that the character must make. Choices available may be influenced by the character's faction, their alliances and cards they have.\nDepending on the choices made, other nodes may hide or reveal themselves.","x":-163,"y":-45,"width":275,"height":280}
	],
